## Purpose and scope of this repository

This repository is an independent disaster-recovery backup. It exists so that
the upstream code, Git history, tags and the automated version-discovery
workflow survive if the upstream project is deleted, goes offline, or is no
longer maintained.

It deliberately does **not** mirror the upstream project's historical GitHub
Releases or release assets.

